WEBVTT

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.050
Star Traps.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:50.940
Time.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.940
Countless stars are glowing.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.700
And they are immeasurable.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:01:00.000
And the enthusiasm that these fights inspire us is endless.

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:25.120
Hermia Nubiae, you know it, it has come to an end, I believe, I made it in the end, there is the Thrabsmaster!

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:45.040
"When a luminous light arrives from the sky to the earth, a new twinkling star will come to awaken huge powers."

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.160
"The great moment has arrived!"

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:53.680
"My star, listen to me!"

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.850
"Give your power to our black sun!"

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:06.480
No, no, no!

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.790
What's going on here?

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.150
Johannes!

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:26.670
Show me where the pieces are.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:35.460
Now the revival of Nemesis is a matter of time.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.040
We're talking right! The visits are over!

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.270
The final adjustments are still to be made.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:44.310
Wow, I feel very tired.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:49.880
This Bey suffered great damage in the battle with Adi.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.340
It took me a lot of time to fix it.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:57.810
Leah, I was very busy with you, Bey, and now you're like new!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.000
Pegasus!

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.060
And Ginga will fly away from his joy!

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:25.640
Maybe he is too tired.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.520
What will it be?

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.000
Well, I will finish it quickly

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.000
and I will go to sleep.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.940
And boom!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.500
This exciting Beyblade Tournament

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.530
enters its final phase.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.670
And now,

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.670
the player who will challenge in the final will be Kenta,

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.450
or maybe...

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:54.880
You can do it, Kenta!

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:58.320
And it's the end!

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.000
Kenta scored continuous wins,

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:04.060
He starts at the top, hitting the opponents and goes to the final!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.980
He can win the tournament!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.210
The winner is Kenta!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:12.690
Yes, well done, Kenta! You took a step away from the big victory!

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:18.240
As you can hear, our commentator, Ginga, has been defeated by this attractive battle!

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.810
What do you mean?

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:22.050
Kenta has the victory in his pocket!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:25.490
Hey, don't forget your position, Ginga!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.690
You're with us as the host commentator!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.890
Don't you make expressions for your friends?

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.820
The comments must be neutral, we don't take anyone's place.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:36.110
Yes, sorry.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:40.920
Kenta has become very strong, and I've withdrawn, my friend.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.270
There won't be a break, the final match starts now.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:49.150
Will the victory belong to Kenta, or is he tired?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.440
- On them, Kenta! - What?

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:57.060
Or will Blader win, who defeated Suto Nagatomo in the second round?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.000
So...

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.680
We have a duel between two Isakson Bladers.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.680
Zingan, who will be the decisive factor in the fight?

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:09.190
Who else will it be? I think it will be the soul.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:12.690
The one who really says it, his heart will be the winner.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.300
Listen, Kenda!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.650
-Three... -Two...

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:16.530
-One... -One...

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:19.010
-Shake your asses! -Shake your asses!

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.430
Nice, Kenda! Stronger, Eros!

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:26.080
-I don't want to fight! -I don't want to fight!

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:30.000
-I want to kill! -I want to kill!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:39.170
Oh yes, I want to play too!

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:43.430
Hey, Mantoka, how are you going to go with the construction of your well?

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:48.510
Hey, Mantoka, I won! Look here!

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:57.650
Mantoka, amazing! It's exactly the same as it was before!

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:58.970
And better!

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:00.000
Mmm, I like it!

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:01.730
My dear Pigassoulis!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.030
Oh, Kenta!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:05.530
I'm sorry I'm late, but your pig is not...

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.170
Madoka!

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:08.170
Thank you!

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.670
You're the first, Madoka!

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.670
I'm grateful to you!

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:15.640
Yes, let's try the pig right now!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.640
Do you want to play?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.290
I'm in!

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.790
Alright, let's go, Kenta!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:20.290
Agreed!

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:21.790
Oh, what are they doing?

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:22.870
Oh, Kenta!

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:26.690
I have a long time to compete, I can't see the time!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.870
You're tough, Kenta!

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:29.830
Of course, Kenta!

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.490
I'll give you everything! Get ready, my friend!

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.390
That's what I wanted to hear!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.330
What's going on, Jinga?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.440
Get down!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:41.090
Oh, no!

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.490
I want to tell you!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:51.880
You're a good girl!

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.640
Who did this to her?

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:57.150
What could it be? There's something on the needle.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:07:00.000
What does it say? What does it say?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:07.090
Let's see. Jinga, Pigasus and you belong to me. I'll be waiting for you on the island of Omiclis, outside the coast.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:07.910
It's a challenge.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:11.910
That means you have a new opponent. What are you going to do now?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:15.780
I'll accept, of course. I can't ignore such a challenge.

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:18.580
And you won't play with me.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:26.850
I'm sorry, I can't. I don't know who he is. My bad. I'll train before our game ends.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.000
-Come on, let's go!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:44.020
There is no one here, it's unfair! Where is my opponent?

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:49.750
Well, Madoka, isn't it strange that the letter came right after your friend's visit?

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:56.580
You're right. The Apostle should be here in a while, so who could it be?

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.000
What's going on? He's got a big grudge against me!

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.150
and throw me from the top!

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:04.690
Get out now I say!

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.330
- What is she doing? - I don't know!

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:17.510
She's working on the sound!

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.450
Oh! Someone's coming!

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.280
It's you!

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:27.870
I'm sorry I'm late, Chinka!

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.690
- Kyoya! - Kyoya!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.340
Where did Kyogya go?

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:39.340
Go and tell Cinca!

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:44.940
I hope you didn't forget your match with Kyogya at the World Championship, Beyblade, eh?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.340
What?

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.610
Exactly!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:50.970
The Galaxian Gan-Gan really came first in the team!

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:54.630
But these two came equal in the individual match!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.720
Now that Pegasus is okay, you know it!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.000
You will definitely turn this half-court!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.140
You are very lucky, Ginga.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.140
It's a bad omen that you are number one.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.140
What?

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:08.260
The thing is...

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:10.220
...that I, Kioia, will defeat you now.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:14.520
And then he says that he cheated on Ginga.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.520
This time he was a fool.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.700
Shut up!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.700
Your mind will become a earthquake!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.870
Ha ha!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.920
Alright, Kioia, I will play.

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:27.190
Now that I am in the scene as a newbie,

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:29.180
we need a good opponent.

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:30.000
So...

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:32.850
These two will never change, after all!

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:36.250
Everything is back to normal, like it used to be!

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.250
Don't be silly, Ginga!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:42.090
There's no stadium with walls here!

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:44.940
The whole island is a huge arena!

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:47.050
Use it all, Ginga!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:48.050
Yes!

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:51.090
It sounds perfect, Kyoya! Let's go!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.520
Three!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:53.520
Two!

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:54.520
One!

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:58.590
Roll the dice!

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:09.080
Go away!

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.080
This time you will lose, you hear me?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.080
Take this! The Wind Wall!

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:21.630
Super!

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:23.630
No, no, he worked hard to improve

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:25.630
the Wind Wall!

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:27.630
His new special move!

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:30.000
It's the second time

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:34.650
It's the release of its new gate, the gate of Amothiela!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:38.530
The gate of Amothiela, look!

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:42.330
Leon and his queen are sweeping the sand on the beach!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.380
Be careful, Ginga!

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:48.540
This sand man is stronger than any other Amothiela!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:52.120
Ha! You haven't seen the power of Leon!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:11:00.000
Come on, Leon, blow up the beach!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:27.170
- He's going to beat Mikas right now! - Go Mikas!

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:36.270
-I'm not done yet. -There he is!

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:42.700
-He's gone! -He's gone for good!

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:44.140
The bird's movement!

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:49.700
You don't know that you have to use only your base's power to throw stones.

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.540
-Enough! -Huh?

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:55.090
Leon is a tough hunter. I've told you before.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:58.020
We don't play normally here, like in the stadium.

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:00.000
Things are more intense here.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:05.260
-A real battle of survival! -So, that's why you chose this place?

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:11.540
Exactly, my friend. The hunter always sets his prey at a critical point for himself.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:16.340
That's how wild lions fight. That's how I'll fight with you.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.370
Yes, I know, Kyogre. That's the only way you know how to fight.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:30.000
I still remember the first time we fought. That's when our competition was enough.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.790
This time, I don't want to lose!

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:37.620
I know your tricks!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:38.820
Go away!

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:42.630
Wrong move!

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.430
You think you'll escape?

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:45.630
You're wrong!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.350
This desert is a very useful weapon!

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:59.690
What?

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.120
a tree to protect from the storm

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.470
Whatever, I didn't smell it

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.450
But...

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.310
Kyo, come on!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.310
From here!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.200
Turn back!

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.220
-Slowly, the vegetables! -Aaaah!

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:44.770
-The things are dark! -And what have you done to the Vigas Show?

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:50.260
You are very good, Gioia! Wonderful battle! I like it very much!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:54.690
Tell me what you have to say now, Giga, because in a little while I will get you out forever!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:14:00.000
I don't think so! I can't do it on my own! The Vigas is capable of doing it!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.490
He has me out, my friend!

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:05.770
Oh, yeah?

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:14.870
Come on, jump!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.890
Special move!

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.780
Star attack!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:26.860
Go!

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.870
Oh, yeah, he's doing the special move!

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:30.000
Yeah!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.660
Lysi can't do his special move!

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:37.440
It's a crucial moment!

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.090
You're too fast!

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:50.020
Yes! The brand new move of Kyoya!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:54.220
The new version 2.5 of the "Water Wall"!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.080
Stropilos! No, Water Wall!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:59.990
Say "Leon's Wall" and it's over!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.670
I don't care about the name!

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:08.000
Leon, you keep running away to Pegaso!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:11.400
You're a loser! Nothing stops me!

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:24.020
Hurray, Pegaso, you're in the corner!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.760
What? Where's Leon?

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:29.220
Ha! You're looking for Leon? Up there!

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.700
How did he get up there?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.890
With the wheel he created, he flew to the sky!

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:40.290
Wow! Haha! That's what I'm talking about!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.580
My turn now!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:44.560
Ah!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.560
I start my own move!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.400
Leon! My opposite wingman!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:54.960
Come on, go! You can do it!

00:15:54.960 --> 00:16:00.000
Impossible! In a swamp full of mud, even if you get into the well, you can't take it!

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:05.620
Look, I see that in the end my trick with Valto failed.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:10.620
Ginga, my only goal was to defeat you, that's why I tried to be strong.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:14.120
Today more than yesterday, tomorrow more than today.

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.960
Just like you are now, you can face me.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.900
I'm the king of beasts.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.400
My Ilia will never get away from me.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.620
You got him, Gioia!

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.000
This is dangerous for Biga.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.860
You fight with courage, Ginga!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.750
And you don't go back, Kyoya!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:37.490
You're the most brave opponent I've ever had!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:40.990
Even so, I won't lose!

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.480
I don't like Ita!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:46.700
If you become stronger, I'll become stronger than you!

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.760
Pegasus agrees with me!

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:50.280
Huh?

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:55.180
We'll become stronger!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:17:00.000
Forget it! The end is here!

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:26.980
-Casa! -Debró! -León! -Dígase!

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.650
-You! -What?

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:40.030
-I've transformed! -Oh, my God!

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:49.350
Madoka, when did you transform into Pegasus and Leontas?

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:54.480
-Why didn't you tell us? -Not you, me!

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:57.910
Then, what's going on?

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.540
What amazing power!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:06.730
Nice!

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.550
You're awesome! Go away!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.060
Leon!

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:14.650
I don't know what happened, but I don't care!

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:15.750
Perfect!

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:18.560
No, where are you going?

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:25.900
Zynga!

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:30.000
The aggressive went away...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.890
It's amazing!

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:35.890
The strength of Leontas is not even that of a defensive Bey.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.890
It's the power of a defensive Bey!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:45.340
No!

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:47.230
Doesn't Pegasus defeat them?

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.500
Incredible, Leon! You kept going!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:57.340
Pegasus!

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:59.620
Yes! I got you!

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:04.340
It will stop you!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:07.330
And now?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:11.820
Go away!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:19.490
What happened? It stopped a minute ago!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:22.090
I don't want to know anything!

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.580
It's too late! Go away, now!

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:28.450
Let's go, Jinga! Go!

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.150
Yes!

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:30.000
Ebro, go!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.570
I don't give a fuck!

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.200
Now, I have to tell this to Mr. Jinka right now!

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:30.000
Ryo and his team are trying to figure out how Kyoya's and Jinka's beys were transformed during the fight!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.000
Kyoya says he doesn't care and he falls.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.120
But then he falls on two unknown Bladers who are fighting.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:38.720
One of them, Yuki, asks for his help but Kyoya refuses.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:42.400
The other Blader, Yohannes, makes his Bey break Yuki's Bey.

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:45.690
Then Ginga enters the fight and defeats Yohannes' Bey.

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:49.730
