00:40:26.120 --> 00:40:27.970
Kyo-Leon was born again!

00:40:27.970 --> 00:40:29.980
So Kyo-ya is also a dragon!

00:40:30.220 --> 00:40:32.610
- How do you play them? - Ah, I got it.

00:40:32.610 --> 00:40:36.110
The power of the star's vibration passed through two beys

00:40:36.110 --> 00:40:44.670
and it was boosted by the players' courage, transforming the beys of Jinga and Kyoya.

00:40:44.670 --> 00:40:47.920
- Kyoya? - Don't confuse me.

00:40:47.920 --> 00:40:50.850
- What? - It happened by mistake.

00:40:50.850 --> 00:40:52.850
So, here's what happened.

00:40:52.850 --> 00:40:55.850
The game in the World Championship evolved.

00:40:55.850 --> 00:40:58.860
And then that explosion in time called you here, eh?

00:40:58.860 --> 00:41:00.000
Nice.

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:01.890
I'll call you a nice pig.

00:41:01.890 --> 00:41:04.870
I'm counting on you, nice pig.

00:41:04.870 --> 00:41:09.860
Hey! If the power of the star's gravity has passed to my dick,

00:41:09.860 --> 00:41:13.860
maybe I'm a legendary blader like Ginga, eh? What do you say?

00:41:13.860 --> 00:41:15.750
What are you talking about?

00:41:15.750 --> 00:41:17.750
There's a possibility.

00:41:17.750 --> 00:41:21.580
If the star's gravity is reinforced by your great courage,

00:41:21.580 --> 00:41:24.580
then your Bey will transform too.

00:41:24.580 --> 00:41:26.430
Yes!

00:41:26.430 --> 00:41:30.000
My sticky eye and I will become legendary bladers!

00:41:30.730 --> 00:41:33.690
Someone tried to stop me from informing you.

00:41:33.840 --> 00:41:35.720
That means something.

00:41:36.050 --> 00:41:37.850
The evil spirit I was telling you about...

00:41:38.010 --> 00:41:40.770
has started promoting the revival of the black sun.

00:41:40.850 --> 00:41:42.250
We have to react.

00:41:42.530 --> 00:41:44.770
-You mean that guy who was whining? -Yes.

00:41:45.200 --> 00:41:50.160
We have to find our allies and prevent the revival of the black sun.

00:41:50.740 --> 00:41:53.020
Okay, put it on me Yu-Gi.

00:41:53.320 --> 00:41:54.680
Bravo, Ginga!

00:41:55.360 --> 00:41:57.560
The revival of the god of fire...

00:41:58.080 --> 00:42:00.000
and the 10 legendary Blades.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:04.070
But we have another serious problem to solve, guys.

00:42:04.070 --> 00:42:06.090
We have to find the other eight.

00:42:06.090 --> 00:42:11.090
Gengage, you and the rest, unite your forces to find the legendary bladers, wherever they are.

00:42:11.090 --> 00:42:12.090
Yes!

00:42:12.090 --> 00:42:14.430
There are only eight left.

00:42:14.430 --> 00:42:16.380
Legendary bladers, very nice.

00:42:16.380 --> 00:42:22.250
Ah, how nice. What a beautiful girl.

00:42:22.250 --> 00:42:24.380
Let's see.

00:42:24.380 --> 00:42:27.380
Ah, what do I have to do now?

00:42:27.380 --> 00:42:29.120
She will be very happy.

00:43:44.970 --> 00:43:52.370
Yuki fights with Yohannes, but things get tough and when he asks for Kyo's help, he denies it and leaves him alone!

00:43:52.370 --> 00:44:00.000
Ginga appears and defeats Yohannes with one throw! Ginga criticizes Yohannes for his shame and Yohannes disappears!

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:02.890
Then Yuki calls Ginga a "thriller blader"

00:44:02.890 --> 00:44:06.890
but he pretends not to have time to explain what he means.

00:44:06.890 --> 00:44:09.200
When he finds his senses again,

00:44:09.200 --> 00:44:12.200
Yuki tells the team a strange story about a shooting star

00:44:12.200 --> 00:44:14.200
that he saw falling from the sky.

00:44:14.200 --> 00:44:17.250
He tells them that the star has chosen some bladers

00:44:17.250 --> 00:44:20.570
who will become known as "thriller bladers".

00:44:20.570 --> 00:44:24.680
He tells them that Kyoya and Ginga are two of the ten "thriller bladers".

00:44:24.680 --> 00:44:27.690
Yuki emphasizes that if the shooting star falls into the wrong hands,

00:44:27.690 --> 00:44:30.000
it will be used for evil purposes.

00:44:30.060 --> 00:44:35.060
Ginga and his friends have to find all the Greek Bladers and save the world.

00:44:35.060 --> 00:44:38.060
But they are already being watched by a very mysterious guy.

00:44:38.060 --> 00:44:40.060
It's Johannes!

00:44:44.990 --> 00:44:51.860
Hello Ginga!

00:44:51.860 --> 00:44:53.940
It's been a long time, buddy!

00:44:53.940 --> 00:44:55.890
How are you doing, buddy?

00:44:55.890 --> 00:44:58.800
Fine! And you, how are you doing?

00:44:58.800 --> 00:45:00.000
I'm fine, thank you!

00:45:00.090 --> 00:45:01.600
Thank you!

00:45:01.600 --> 00:45:04.120
What are you doing? Why did you call me, Ginga?

00:45:04.120 --> 00:45:08.410
Masamuki, I'm sorry. Can you please show me the Striker?

00:45:08.410 --> 00:45:10.130
I want to check something.

00:45:10.130 --> 00:45:13.250
What brings you here again? What do you want to see in the Striker?

00:45:13.250 --> 00:45:16.050
I'll explain. Show it to me.

00:45:16.050 --> 00:45:21.130
To get closer? What exactly do you want to see?

00:45:21.130 --> 00:45:22.450
It's not one of us.

00:45:22.450 --> 00:45:26.150
What? What is it? What do you want to say, Ginga?

00:45:26.150 --> 00:45:30.000
I don't know what you mean and I don't like the subordinates.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:34.480
I'm sorry, I thought you were one of the chosen ones.

00:45:34.480 --> 00:45:37.860
-Who? -Here, take a look at this.

00:45:37.860 --> 00:45:40.290
-Wow! -Boom!

00:45:40.290 --> 00:45:42.660
I have a new bae, my friend!

00:45:42.660 --> 00:45:49.870
-The friendly Pegasus! -Wow, my God! It's incredible!

00:45:49.870 --> 00:45:52.330
-A legendary blader? -Oh, yes.

00:45:52.330 --> 00:45:56.630
I thought that among the members of Wang Hu Zhong and the Bladers,

00:45:56.630 --> 00:46:00.000
we might have found a legendary blader.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:05.180
The current Madoka hasn't changed a thing, not even in me, not even in the others, Bay.

00:46:05.180 --> 00:46:11.000
Hmm, so far, the only legendary Bladers we've found are Jinka and Kyoya, right?

00:46:11.000 --> 00:46:14.210
Where are the other eight? They'll be somewhere.

00:46:14.210 --> 00:46:17.890
So you're telling me that if I were one of the legendary Bladers,

00:46:17.890 --> 00:46:20.450
Stryker would have transformed like Pegasus?

00:46:20.450 --> 00:46:22.730
Is that what you're telling me? Huh? Is that what you're telling me?

00:46:22.730 --> 00:46:27.900
Yes! When the courage of a Blader is combined with the power of the star,

00:46:27.900 --> 00:46:30.000
Bay is reborn.

00:46:30.120 --> 00:46:32.120
The legendary Blader!

00:46:32.120 --> 00:46:34.730
I got it!

00:46:34.730 --> 00:46:36.730
I'm very brave!

00:46:36.730 --> 00:46:38.730
I'm the first one!

00:46:38.730 --> 00:46:40.730
And I will try my best to become the legendary Blader!

00:46:40.730 --> 00:46:42.550
You'll see!

00:46:42.550 --> 00:46:44.550
That's how I want you, Masamuke!

00:46:44.550 --> 00:46:46.550
Since Jinga is here, it won't be difficult!

00:46:46.550 --> 00:46:48.980
You're right!

00:46:48.980 --> 00:46:50.930
Stop! What do you mean now?

00:46:50.930 --> 00:46:52.910
You're right!

00:46:52.910 --> 00:46:54.910
So far, we've only found two.

00:46:54.910 --> 00:47:00.000
But Masamuke is not the only one who can become the legendary Blader, you know?

00:47:00.220 --> 00:47:02.220
Don't lose your hopes, okay?

00:47:02.220 --> 00:47:04.720
Ha! Why should I lose my hopes?

00:47:05.710 --> 00:47:09.190
Right! I can also become a legendary Blader!

00:47:09.190 --> 00:47:13.830
The power of the star's gravity has probably passed to my dachshund!

00:47:13.830 --> 00:47:17.250
I just have to bring this power to the surface!

00:47:17.250 --> 00:47:21.750
If I become stronger, the gravity will definitely join me!

00:47:21.750 --> 00:47:24.070
And I will become legendary too!

00:47:24.070 --> 00:47:26.910
A legendary Blader, like Ginga!

00:47:26.910 --> 00:47:28.410
So, see you later!

00:47:28.410 --> 00:47:28.960
Huh?

00:47:28.960 --> 00:47:29.860
Yes!

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:32.800
Since I want to become a hero, I have to train!

00:47:32.800 --> 00:47:33.800
Give it all!

00:47:34.030 --> 00:47:38.030
Yes! Soon I'll become a hero too, Blader, you know it!

00:47:38.030 --> 00:47:39.630
I'm coming to you!

00:47:40.450 --> 00:47:43.050
If something changes here, I'll let you know immediately.

00:47:43.500 --> 00:47:44.600
Thank you!

00:47:44.600 --> 00:47:46.000
See ya!

00:47:48.170 --> 00:47:50.170
Neither Masamu nor Oda-san.

00:47:50.620 --> 00:47:53.770
And I was sure that they would also be heroic, Bladers.

00:47:54.150 --> 00:47:57.150
However, in Europe we didn't find heroic Bladers.

00:47:57.700 --> 00:48:00.000
Their search won't be that simple.

00:48:00.510 --> 00:48:04.150
There's a possibility that Yu and Tsubasa might be the candidates.

00:48:04.230 --> 00:48:05.950
But no one knows where they are.

00:48:06.030 --> 00:48:09.710
After the end of the competition, they went for sports preparation.

00:48:09.790 --> 00:48:11.440
We don't know where they went.

00:48:11.780 --> 00:48:13.630
That's right. Tsubasa.

00:48:15.280 --> 00:48:17.480
Did you learn something about him, Dad?

00:48:17.500 --> 00:48:21.170
Er... no, nothing.

00:48:21.250 --> 00:48:23.300
-So, Hikaru, how's the research going? -Good.

00:48:23.350 --> 00:48:25.080
We're done with the analysis.

00:48:25.160 --> 00:48:27.560
Guys, look at the monitor now.

00:48:28.580 --> 00:48:30.000
On the fly, it looks like...

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:35.490
The moment when the star system enters the stratosphere and scatters on the Earth.

00:48:35.490 --> 00:48:36.490
Wow!

00:48:36.490 --> 00:48:38.490
Everything happened so quickly!

00:48:38.490 --> 00:48:41.490
Indeed, it's hard to understand what happened.

00:48:41.490 --> 00:48:46.170
But when you see it, it's all clear!

00:48:46.170 --> 00:48:47.160
Look at this!

00:48:47.160 --> 00:48:50.820
This is how the separation and scattering of light is repeated.

00:48:50.820 --> 00:48:54.820
Calculating the current, we found that the light fell here.

00:48:54.820 --> 00:48:59.480
In the area around this distant island.

00:48:59.480 --> 00:49:00.000
Perfect!

00:49:00.380 --> 00:49:01.720
But they are very far away.

00:49:01.720 --> 00:49:05.240
If he fell there, he will be found there by the legendary Blader!

00:49:05.240 --> 00:49:07.810
We have to go and see Dad right now!

00:49:07.810 --> 00:49:09.550
I'm coming with you, Jinga!

00:49:09.550 --> 00:49:10.630
Me too!

00:49:10.630 --> 00:49:12.390
Perfect! I'm coming too!

00:49:12.390 --> 00:49:13.510
Let's go, guys!

00:49:13.510 --> 00:49:14.330
Yes!

00:49:14.330 --> 00:49:17.290
If the evil spirit that will revive the black sun

00:49:17.290 --> 00:49:20.500
recovers the wound, we will have problems.

00:49:20.500 --> 00:49:22.410
You go to this island first.

00:49:22.410 --> 00:49:24.850
And then you search every island.

00:49:24.850 --> 00:49:26.320
Jinga, listen to me.

00:49:26.320 --> 00:49:30.000
You and the others have to find the rest of the legendary Bladers.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:33.600
As soon as we have news, you'll be informed.

00:49:33.600 --> 00:49:35.140
We're counting on you.

00:49:35.140 --> 00:49:36.040
Right!

00:49:36.040 --> 00:49:38.940
We're going to do some research on the 8 legendary Bladers, huh?

00:49:38.940 --> 00:49:41.620
I find them difficult, just like all the other kids.

00:49:41.620 --> 00:49:44.360
One question, Jinga. What about Kyogre?

00:49:44.360 --> 00:49:45.670
Kyogre?

00:49:45.670 --> 00:49:48.250
Yes, Kyogre.

00:49:48.250 --> 00:49:51.640
Kyogre is one of the legendary Bladers, right?

00:49:51.640 --> 00:49:53.780
Shouldn't he come with us?

00:49:53.780 --> 00:49:56.050
Again, Kyogre.

00:49:56.050 --> 00:49:58.860
It would be perfect if he wanted to come with us, after all.

00:49:58.860 --> 00:50:00.000
You're wrong.

00:50:00.120 --> 00:50:02.120
We're talking about Kyo-ya, guys.

00:50:02.120 --> 00:50:03.570
He's a mystery.

00:50:07.620 --> 00:50:10.940
Leon Kynodontas!

00:50:15.770 --> 00:50:17.270
Well done, buddy!

00:50:17.270 --> 00:50:21.770
Now that Leon has become an offensive Bay, I'll be invincible!

00:50:21.770 --> 00:50:26.320
I'll improve his abilities, and I'll take care of Ginga, no matter what!

00:50:26.760 --> 00:50:29.100
I'm throwing the sword!

00:50:39.080 --> 00:50:43.620
You know, you'll probably train with the new Leon to beat Jinga.

00:50:44.700 --> 00:50:46.700
Hmm, that's Kyogre!

00:50:48.040 --> 00:50:51.760
Hey, Jinga! What kind of person is Kyogre, after all?

00:50:52.230 --> 00:50:53.130
What kind?

00:50:53.670 --> 00:50:59.190
I saw the world championship Beyblade and I know he's a great player, but again...

00:51:00.480 --> 00:51:02.200
Come on, help me!

00:51:06.800 --> 00:51:08.920
Hey, dude, don't you want to fight?

00:51:09.000 --> 00:51:11.480
-Don't talk to me like that. -What?

00:51:11.760 --> 00:51:13.320
You're a blader, aren't you?

00:51:13.680 --> 00:51:16.640
Learn to pull them out on your own.

00:51:17.480 --> 00:51:22.210
I can't believe Kyoya is this legendary blader.

00:51:22.290 --> 00:51:24.820
Yes, I understand why you're telling the truth.

00:51:24.900 --> 00:51:26.740
Kyoya is very strange.

00:51:26.820 --> 00:51:28.580
You're not a team, guys.

00:51:28.660 --> 00:51:30.000
And he's got a great sense of humor.

00:51:30.090 --> 00:51:33.680
I don't care about Ginga's death, you know!

00:51:33.680 --> 00:51:36.680
Yeah, we need good bladers in our place.

00:51:36.680 --> 00:51:38.760
We will deal with evil.

00:51:38.760 --> 00:51:41.160
But Kyogre...

00:51:41.160 --> 00:51:43.430
Wait a minute.

00:51:43.430 --> 00:51:46.380
I know more about him than anyone else.

00:51:46.380 --> 00:51:49.380
He has a self-centered and tough side, without doubt.

00:51:49.380 --> 00:51:51.300
But inside him, he has a soul.

00:51:51.300 --> 00:51:54.220
And a great courage, like all of us, guys.

00:51:54.220 --> 00:51:56.490
I accept him.

00:51:56.490 --> 00:51:59.120
Don't worry, Yuki.

00:51:59.120 --> 00:52:00.000
Okay.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:04.050
We have to leave immediately. The enemy has already made some moves.

00:52:04.050 --> 00:52:06.050
Yes, friend, you're right.

00:52:06.050 --> 00:52:11.010
I have to go to the workshop to get the suitcase with my tools. I will need them for sure.

00:52:11.010 --> 00:52:13.420
See you, dad. I'm in a hurry.

00:52:13.420 --> 00:52:15.420
Okay, be careful.

00:52:15.420 --> 00:52:20.030
I'm sorry, sir. Goodbye.

00:52:20.030 --> 00:52:30.000
There are eight more legendary bladers in the world. The kids will do it all by themselves.

00:52:30.510 --> 00:52:33.340
We will help them as much as we can to find them.

00:52:33.340 --> 00:52:35.220
So, did you hear what happened?

00:52:35.220 --> 00:52:40.000
- Choubassa? - Yes.

00:52:40.000 --> 00:52:42.050
The world is big.

00:52:42.050 --> 00:52:46.210
Ginga and the others can't cover all the dust, you have to help them too.

00:52:46.210 --> 00:52:50.340
Also, don't forget, you have to train hard as a blader.

00:52:50.340 --> 00:52:55.840
There's a high chance that a blader of your level is one of the legendary bladers.

00:52:55.840 --> 00:52:58.390
I got it.

00:53:06.440 --> 00:53:07.940
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:53:08.770 --> 00:53:12.170
The same badgers again! How long do you want to be ready?

00:53:12.740 --> 00:53:17.340
Oh, I didn't do it on purpose. I'm sorry, but I always work with a plan.

00:53:17.820 --> 00:53:20.920
And we don't know how long we'll miss this time.

00:53:24.240 --> 00:53:27.470
We're saying goodbye to our city for a while.

00:53:27.780 --> 00:53:30.000
I like it a lot, by the way.

00:53:30.030 --> 00:53:35.330
I couldn't follow you to the World Championship, but now, Jinga, I'm ready for anything!

00:53:35.510 --> 00:53:41.290
-Kenda... -Jinga, while I'll help you find the legendary Bladers, I can become a legendary too!

00:53:41.730 --> 00:53:46.780
-Xoti, the two of us will be at 8 o'clock! -Yes! You can do it too, Kenda!

00:53:47.060 --> 00:53:52.600
-You can definitely become a legendary too! -Yes, I hope you become a real Jinga!

00:53:52.800 --> 00:53:56.600
But what's ahead of me is to become stronger and have more chances!

00:53:56.720 --> 00:54:00.000
If you need any help, I'm right here next to you.

00:54:00.060 --> 00:54:04.330
You two are very close, aren't you Kenta?

00:54:04.330 --> 00:54:08.330
You're lucky you can trust your friends.

00:54:08.330 --> 00:54:12.450
I spent all my life doing research all by myself.

00:54:12.450 --> 00:54:15.730
I'm jealous of your friendship with Ginga. Yuki!

00:54:15.730 --> 00:54:17.730
What are you talking about?

00:54:17.730 --> 00:54:20.590
Don't be afraid, you're one of us now, Yuki.

00:54:20.590 --> 00:54:25.600
Right. If you weren't Yuki, who knows what we'd have now.

00:54:25.600 --> 00:54:27.600
You're really one of us.

00:54:27.600 --> 00:54:30.000
Because we don't know what's going to happen to us.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:32.790
Wait for us, we have to be a connected team!

00:54:32.790 --> 00:54:34.200
Kids!

00:54:35.990 --> 00:54:36.990
I won't disappoint you!

00:54:36.990 --> 00:54:37.910
Great!

00:54:37.910 --> 00:54:40.020
Oh, Yuki!

00:54:40.020 --> 00:54:42.020
Zito! Let's go, kids!

00:54:42.020 --> 00:54:46.780
Shukenda!

00:54:46.780 --> 00:54:54.990
Calm down, finally!

00:54:54.990 --> 00:54:56.990
I'll be born again on this trip, for sure!

00:54:56.990 --> 00:55:00.000
I'll work hard and I'll become even stronger!

00:55:00.030 --> 00:55:02.710
The legendary Blader!

00:55:02.710 --> 00:55:06.800
What's going on there?

00:55:06.800 --> 00:55:14.000
What are all these cats?

00:55:14.000 --> 00:55:18.270
Oh, it's you again!

00:55:18.270 --> 00:55:24.800
I've been waiting for you!

00:55:36.200 --> 00:55:38.860
Yes, I was waiting for you.

00:55:38.860 --> 00:55:40.860
Well done, cheater. What do you want?

00:55:40.860 --> 00:55:42.940
It's not clear.

00:55:42.940 --> 00:55:48.250
Unfortunately, I didn't think that some legendary bladers would have already been found.

00:55:48.250 --> 00:55:51.290
I admit that you confused me yesterday, guys.

00:55:51.290 --> 00:55:57.370
But now that I think about it, you made me try to give explanations in front of all of you.

00:55:57.370 --> 00:56:00.000
I told you the whole story, didn't I?

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:02.000
It's him, right?

00:56:02.000 --> 00:56:05.000
The new era for Beyblade is coming soon!

00:56:05.000 --> 00:56:07.000
New era for Beyblade?

00:56:07.000 --> 00:56:11.000
Exactly! When the black sun wakes up with the power of the curse,

00:56:11.000 --> 00:56:14.910
the gate of a new era will open for all of us!

00:56:14.910 --> 00:56:16.920
That's why I have to take you with me!

00:56:16.920 --> 00:56:19.070
Come on, you too, Ginga!

00:56:19.070 --> 00:56:23.070
Let Pegasus give the power of the star to the black sun!

00:56:23.070 --> 00:56:24.920
Conquer the Earth!

00:56:24.920 --> 00:56:27.930
I was right! You have broken with the bad guys, then!

00:56:27.930 --> 00:56:30.000
And not only that, you are the bad guy!

00:56:30.090 --> 00:56:32.100
-Me? Bad?

00:56:32.100 --> 00:56:33.880
-Hehehe...

00:56:33.880 --> 00:56:35.880
-If you push me, I might become one.

00:56:35.880 --> 00:56:38.060
-Why didn't you come with the good?

00:56:38.060 --> 00:56:41.950
-You don't want us to build this new future together for Beyblade?

00:56:41.950 --> 00:56:44.320
-What? Never!

00:56:44.320 --> 00:56:46.340
-What are you laughing about?

00:56:46.340 --> 00:56:49.230
-After the black sun brings the darkness to Earth,

00:56:49.230 --> 00:56:53.120
-I won't let you use the Pegasus for a bad cause!

00:56:53.120 --> 00:56:56.450
-So he fooled you with the words he told you.

00:56:56.450 --> 00:57:00.000
-Well then, I'll teach you a lesson.

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:04.180
I will win here and now, and I will take you, Pegasus, with all my might!

00:57:06.500 --> 00:57:07.860
I won't let you go!

00:57:10.000 --> 00:57:11.700
Nice joke, buddy!

00:57:13.610 --> 00:57:15.680
Yuki, leave it to me, okay?

00:57:16.040 --> 00:57:17.040
No, Ginga!

00:57:17.430 --> 00:57:19.050
Here is the nice Pegasus!

00:57:19.310 --> 00:57:20.430
Hit the cat!

00:57:20.820 --> 00:57:21.820
No way!

00:57:22.060 --> 00:57:23.600
Now you're right, little one!

00:57:23.820 --> 00:57:24.820
I'm starting!

00:57:24.900 --> 00:57:26.630
-Throw her in the fire! -Throw her in the fire!

00:57:34.800 --> 00:57:37.800
What is the power of your poison? You'll see now!

00:57:37.800 --> 00:57:41.660
You won't save me!

00:57:42.640 --> 00:57:47.950
It would have been good if you didn't underestimate the Beetlings.

00:57:47.950 --> 00:57:57.670
Hey, come back! What was that?

00:57:58.720 --> 00:58:00.000
Go away!

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:01.500
Acceleration!

00:58:01.500 --> 00:58:02.500
What?

00:58:02.500 --> 00:58:05.000
In such a narrow space he can't attack.

00:58:05.000 --> 00:58:09.000
And Pegasus can't develop a rotating speed like Stadio.

00:58:09.000 --> 00:58:12.000
Pegasus can't use his power here!

00:58:13.000 --> 00:58:15.000
My turn now, buddy!

00:58:20.790 --> 00:58:24.310
He must have enough space to accelerate, right?

00:58:24.310 --> 00:58:26.100
I found it!

00:58:26.100 --> 00:58:30.000
Johannes' spinning wheel is 17 km/h, that's why he can...

00:58:30.410 --> 00:58:32.910
in an offensive bay, like Pegasus.

00:58:33.800 --> 00:58:37.740
I'm going to beat you up now.

00:58:37.740 --> 00:58:40.720
I'm going to beat Lynx!

00:58:40.720 --> 00:58:47.660
Go away!

00:58:47.660 --> 00:58:49.280
I don't believe it!

00:58:49.280 --> 00:58:52.760
You made me a place that has the advantage of your base!

00:58:52.760 --> 00:58:54.110
Neither did I.

00:58:54.110 --> 00:58:56.610
You're both slow and useless.

00:58:56.610 --> 00:58:57.610
What did you just say?

00:58:57.610 --> 00:58:58.520
Go away, Lynx!

00:59:06.560 --> 00:59:10.630
-You're mine now! -I'm going to kill you!

00:59:12.560 --> 00:59:17.190
-I'm going to kill you! -That's bad!

00:59:20.160 --> 00:59:23.610
-And now? -In this place, victory is mine!

00:59:23.690 --> 00:59:27.680
-I'm going to kill you! -Run, Lynx!

00:59:27.680 --> 00:59:29.730
I'm going to kill you!

00:59:37.160 --> 00:59:39.730
- What? - What?

00:59:39.730 --> 00:59:41.800
How do you do this thing?

00:59:41.800 --> 00:59:43.550
Popo, it's like a cat.

00:59:43.550 --> 00:59:45.160
Perfect balance.

00:59:45.160 --> 00:59:47.120
I'll fix it right now.

00:59:47.120 --> 00:59:48.880
Evros, get out of here!

00:59:48.880 --> 00:59:51.790
What did I tell you, all the power?

00:59:51.790 --> 00:59:57.900
I told you not to underestimate Link, buddy.

00:59:57.900 --> 00:59:59.700
Huh?

01:00:01.560 --> 01:00:03.960
-No! -That was it!

01:00:03.960 --> 01:00:06.960
-Links suddenly gained height! -What?

01:00:06.960 --> 01:00:09.960
-Is he strong? -So, a new tactic!

01:00:09.960 --> 01:00:14.290
I'll send him with a sword attack!

01:00:15.430 --> 01:00:19.820
-Here we go again! -Links is strong again!

01:00:19.820 --> 01:00:23.360
-Poo-poo! -Look!

01:00:23.360 --> 01:00:26.370
Link's spinning wheel works at three heights!

01:00:26.370 --> 01:00:30.000
The maximum is 22 kilometers, the same as Bixi's height!

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:54.730
I admit, the guy is super.

01:00:54.730 --> 01:00:57.740
He's good. He's a cat, guys.

01:00:57.740 --> 01:00:59.740
He's very wild, like a lynx.

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:06.490
There's Zynga!

01:01:06.490 --> 01:01:09.080
Don't be afraid, guys! I've got it under control!

01:01:09.080 --> 01:01:19.430
The

01:01:19.430 --> 01:01:29.730
Zynga!

01:01:32.620 --> 01:01:34.410
-Kyo-Gya! -It's me!

01:01:34.410 --> 01:01:36.890
Why are you struggling so much with him?

01:01:36.890 --> 01:01:40.800
Why are you wasting your energy on a useless little cat like him?

01:01:40.800 --> 01:01:43.110
-What? -Kyo-Gya!

01:01:43.110 --> 01:01:46.510
Leon will destroy him in one moment!

01:01:50.340 --> 01:01:54.370
What happened? Are you also a legendary Blader?

01:01:54.370 --> 01:01:57.910
I might be. You'll see in a bit!

01:02:00.160 --> 01:02:03.430
I can't believe it, two bladers have already been found!

01:02:03.430 --> 01:02:08.740
Yes!

01:02:11.480 --> 01:02:13.740
What's going on?

01:02:13.740 --> 01:02:18.710
This is not fair, two against one!

01:02:18.710 --> 01:02:21.710
But it doesn't matter, the fight ends here today!

01:02:22.710 --> 01:02:28.580
That doesn't mean that I give up the fight for the power of the star's attack!

01:02:30.090 --> 01:02:32.990
What a coincidence! Cut it whenever you want, cat!

01:02:32.990 --> 01:02:36.210
We'll talk about it later!

01:02:36.210 --> 01:02:39.370
It was a lie!

01:02:39.370 --> 01:02:41.370
Kyoya pulled the cat!

01:02:41.370 --> 01:02:42.590
Benki!

01:02:42.590 --> 01:02:46.540
Kyoya! What are you doing here?

01:02:46.540 --> 01:02:48.540
Benki told me about the mission.

01:02:48.540 --> 01:02:50.960
Are you coming?

01:02:50.960 --> 01:02:53.510
Kyoya? Will you help us?

01:02:53.510 --> 01:02:55.530
I don't know if I'll take your place.

01:02:55.530 --> 01:02:57.100
What?

01:02:57.100 --> 01:02:58.770
Tell me!

01:02:58.770 --> 01:02:59.700
However...

01:03:00.060 --> 01:03:03.060
If you intend to find the other 8 legendary Bladers,

01:03:03.060 --> 01:03:05.060
then I will come with you.

01:03:05.060 --> 01:03:08.050
I will defeat all of them, you hear me?

01:03:08.050 --> 01:03:09.040
Kyoya!

01:03:09.040 --> 01:03:13.030
Only if I come with you, I will quickly achieve my goal.

01:03:14.030 --> 01:03:18.120
Jenga, I will rule you after them.

01:03:18.120 --> 01:03:19.100
Yes, Kyoya!

01:03:19.100 --> 01:03:21.100
What are you waiting for, eh?

01:03:21.100 --> 01:03:23.010
The journey begins now.

01:03:23.010 --> 01:03:27.600
Wait, Kyoya!

01:03:27.600 --> 01:03:30.000
Oh, oh, oh, what a mystery, kid.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:33.000
But his courage will help us in the mission!

01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:35.000
Hey, Jinga!

01:03:35.000 --> 01:03:36.880
You think she's a good idea, don't you?

01:03:36.880 --> 01:03:39.880
Yes, I'm sure you'll understand soon enough.

01:03:39.880 --> 01:03:41.700
Okay, I hope you're right.

01:03:41.700 --> 01:03:43.880
Kyoya, stop!

01:03:43.880 --> 01:03:47.120
Wait! We're coming, Kyoya!

01:03:47.120 --> 01:03:49.860
Kyoya, do you know where we're going?

01:03:49.860 --> 01:03:50.840
Oh!

01:03:50.840 --> 01:03:54.510
Hey, kids!

01:05:15.200 --> 01:05:17.050
In the previous episode...

01:05:17.050 --> 01:05:21.050
Ginga and his friends set off on a journey in search of the 8 legendary bladers.

01:05:21.050 --> 01:05:24.060
But they happen to find Yohannes, who wants to stop him.

01:05:24.060 --> 01:05:26.560
Yohannes provokes Ginga into a fierce battle.

01:05:26.560 --> 01:05:30.000
Ginga and the world's biggest, Spiro, cut off the beatlings.

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:34.220
But Lynx has a Manta with the shield of heights and Pegasus can't beat him.

01:05:34.220 --> 01:05:37.220
Gengar retreats as he attacks John's Bey.

01:05:37.220 --> 01:05:43.490
The battle's evolution is not positive for Gengar, but he gets an unbeatable ally, Kyo-ya.

01:05:43.490 --> 01:05:47.410
Kyo-ya expels Leonta and takes a powerful blow against Lynx.

01:05:47.410 --> 01:05:52.760
John promises that it's unfair to face both Kyo-ya and Gengar at the same time.

01:05:52.760 --> 01:05:59.250
Kyo-ya announces that he will help Gengar and his friends in the search for the other 8 legendary bladers.

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:03.000
He explains to them that he wants to find them and defeat them!

01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:05.830
And when he does it, he will only fight with Ginga!

01:06:05.830 --> 01:06:13.370
To prove to everyone who is the best Blender in the world!

01:06:13.370 --> 01:06:15.140
"Katastrofeas El Draco"

01:06:31.530 --> 01:06:34.040
Oh, this island looks very nice!

01:06:34.040 --> 01:06:38.830
Do you think we'll find a legendary blader here?

01:06:38.830 --> 01:06:42.360
Yes, if my calculations are correct.

01:06:42.360 --> 01:06:46.960
The star's comet fell unquestionably on this island.

01:06:46.960 --> 01:06:49.050
Are you sure?

01:06:49.050 --> 01:06:54.960
Yes, I am. The light that fell from the sky will awaken the beam of fire and collide the Earth.

01:06:54.960 --> 01:06:55.770
What?

01:06:55.770 --> 01:07:00.000
The legend says so, the legend of the island. It's very old.

01:07:00.280 --> 01:07:03.010
He's talking about the fall of the star's gravity.

01:07:03.010 --> 01:07:05.030
A celestial light that falls.

01:07:05.030 --> 01:07:20.770
Satan!

01:07:20.770 --> 01:07:21.830
Be careful, Mantokas.

01:07:21.830 --> 01:07:22.830
Thank you.

01:07:22.830 --> 01:07:25.940
I'll ask you again. Are you sure, guys?

01:07:25.940 --> 01:07:28.980
There's no timetable. The next one is tomorrow morning.

01:07:28.980 --> 01:07:29.980
Uh, yes.

01:07:30.480 --> 01:07:33.480
You have to find the legendary Blader right now!

01:07:33.480 --> 01:07:35.480
We don't have any other choice.

01:07:35.480 --> 01:07:36.480
Come to think of it...

01:07:36.480 --> 01:07:39.330
The torch can burn at any moment.

01:07:39.330 --> 01:07:41.920
Well, the decision is yours.

01:07:41.920 --> 01:07:44.920
I would still go back if I were in your shoes.

01:07:44.920 --> 01:07:46.840
Everything will be fine.

01:07:46.840 --> 01:07:48.840
Thank you for bringing us here, sir.

01:07:48.840 --> 01:07:52.040
Yes, thank you for your effort.

01:07:53.060 --> 01:07:54.920
I see nothing stops you.

01:07:54.920 --> 01:07:57.930
There is a village in the west of the jungle.

01:07:57.930 --> 01:08:00.000
So if you get stuck, go there.

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:07.040
Not for help. But remember, the villagers of this village are not very friendly with foreigners, do you understand?

01:08:07.040 --> 01:08:11.790
- What? - Yes!

01:08:11.790 --> 01:08:18.240
Oh! I think it's time for me to go. Be careful, guys!

01:08:18.240 --> 01:08:19.660
Go!

01:08:19.660 --> 01:08:22.150
We have to give it to him, too. Move!

01:08:22.150 --> 01:08:24.390
Thanks, Kyoya!

01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:41.820
Well, now you don't really exist in the village he told us about.

01:08:41.820 --> 01:08:44.050
Hyojinga!

01:08:44.050 --> 01:08:47.650
Yes? You must be right.

01:08:47.650 --> 01:08:52.980
The island is not that big. The village will be close. Let's move on.

01:08:52.980 --> 01:08:58.240
Stop for a moment. Oh, without help.

01:08:58.240 --> 01:09:00.000
A life the same and the same.

01:09:00.120 --> 01:09:02.720
You're delaying us, so go back!

01:09:02.820 --> 01:09:05.090
What did you say? You're not pregnant?

01:09:05.090 --> 01:09:06.980
Why do you say bad things?

01:09:06.980 --> 01:09:09.500
Oh, you're amazing!

01:09:09.500 --> 01:09:12.620
That's how he said it!

01:09:12.620 --> 01:09:17.960
Thank you very much, Benky!

01:09:17.960 --> 01:09:19.840
Eh? No problem!

01:09:19.840 --> 01:09:23.740
I'm doing it for Kyogre, because he doesn't want us to delay!

01:09:26.270 --> 01:09:28.930
Wow! Here it is!

01:09:30.440 --> 01:09:33.070
-The village! -We did it!

01:09:33.150 --> 01:09:35.700
Are we going to find a legendary blader?

01:09:35.800 --> 01:09:38.160
Why don't we go ask?

01:09:38.970 --> 01:09:43.870
Hello! Excuse me, sir!

01:09:43.990 --> 01:09:48.210
Who are you? Why did you come to this island?

01:09:48.250 --> 01:09:52.210
-We're looking for a friend. -Is that so?

01:09:55.580 --> 01:10:00.000
Is this Beyblade? We don't like Beyblades.

01:10:00.060 --> 01:10:03.200
- What? How can you do that, sir?

01:10:03.200 --> 01:10:05.200
- Let's go, let's go!

01:10:05.200 --> 01:10:06.200
- It's me, it's me!

01:10:06.200 --> 01:10:12.410
- What's going on?

01:10:12.410 --> 01:10:17.880
- This is very strange.

01:10:17.880 --> 01:10:23.130
- What's going on here?

01:10:23.130 --> 01:10:26.080
- They're all hiding us inside their houses.

01:10:26.080 --> 01:10:30.000
- Hello, listen, we're here for a good cause.

01:10:32.200 --> 01:10:35.320
Please open the door! I beg you!

01:10:36.570 --> 01:10:39.730
Tell me, are you all Bladers?

01:10:40.370 --> 01:10:45.690
Yes, and I am the world champion!

01:10:45.880 --> 01:10:47.060
I am called Ginga!

01:10:50.230 --> 01:10:51.510
What have you done?

01:10:51.670 --> 01:10:54.430
We don't like your comrade taking the road now!

01:10:54.790 --> 01:10:56.640
Are you a Blader? Are you a threat?

01:10:56.920 --> 01:10:58.800
Go away from our village right now!

01:10:59.000 --> 01:11:00.000
Yes, go away, kid!

01:11:00.320 --> 01:11:02.200
The chief is right.

01:11:02.200 --> 01:11:04.350
Let's get out of here.

01:11:04.350 --> 01:11:06.170
Get out of here, now!

01:11:06.170 --> 01:11:07.730
Do you want to fight?

01:11:07.730 --> 01:11:09.170
Not now, Kyoya.

01:11:09.170 --> 01:11:12.250
I think it's better to get out of here now.

01:11:12.250 --> 01:11:14.970
Yeah, you're right. Let's go, guys.

01:11:14.970 --> 01:11:17.780
Kyoya, come on!

01:11:17.780 --> 01:11:22.680
Oh, they did it.

01:11:22.680 --> 01:11:25.580
What kind of people are they?

01:11:25.580 --> 01:11:28.570
So, why did they bring us here?

01:11:28.570 --> 01:11:30.000
You know why they brought us here.

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:33.000
Is this some kind of antipathy for the Bladers and Oya?

01:11:33.000 --> 01:11:34.890
How should I know?

01:11:34.890 --> 01:11:39.780
Oh, and we had such a long trip and I feel so tired.

01:11:39.780 --> 01:11:42.780
Oh, I'm starving like a wolf.

01:11:42.780 --> 01:11:44.860
What do we do now?

01:11:44.860 --> 01:11:49.340
Good question, Yuki.

01:11:49.340 --> 01:11:58.730
Oh, a bee.

01:11:58.730 --> 01:12:00.000
Nice, let's go again.

01:12:09.050 --> 01:12:19.030
- Where am I going? - Do you train alone?

01:12:19.030 --> 01:12:25.030
- Oh, Benky, you scared the poor little girl. - I'm not scared!

01:12:25.030 --> 01:12:28.920
- Don't be afraid. We're bladers like you. Voila!

01:12:30.280 --> 01:12:35.040
Ah, hey, what's your name, little one?

01:12:35.040 --> 01:12:37.000
Si, Sila.

01:12:37.000 --> 01:12:38.510
Ah, Sila, huh?

01:12:38.510 --> 01:12:41.200
Let me see your bae for a moment.

01:12:41.200 --> 01:12:43.690
Uh-huh.

01:12:43.690 --> 01:12:47.700
Popo, an Earth Fire Blaze, a 4-5-F.

01:12:47.700 --> 01:12:50.130
But the combination of a high power,

01:12:50.130 --> 01:12:52.850
with a endurance wheel makes it unstable.

01:12:52.850 --> 01:12:54.590
Can I try something?

01:12:54.590 --> 01:12:56.490
Sure.

01:12:56.490 --> 01:13:00.000
Let's see, this is what I want, and this here...

01:13:01.660 --> 01:13:03.360
Nice! Ready!

01:13:03.360 --> 01:13:08.210
I took Manda and transferred him to the Jewish Defense Force base in Bay.

01:13:08.210 --> 01:13:10.280
Let's see what Scylla can do!

01:13:10.280 --> 01:13:11.590
Ok!

01:13:11.590 --> 01:13:28.360
Do you want to play together?

01:13:28.360 --> 01:13:30.000
Ok!

01:13:33.200 --> 01:13:36.700
The bars are a bit lower. Aim at the front and throw.

01:13:37.110 --> 01:13:37.810
Let's go.

01:13:38.250 --> 01:13:40.420
Three, two, one...

01:13:40.520 --> 01:13:42.100
-Throw, you morons! -Throw, you morons!

01:13:43.460 --> 01:13:51.560
We'll get lost again with these nonsense.

01:13:51.760 --> 01:13:53.260
Don't worry.

01:13:53.360 --> 01:13:55.970
Can't you see that in a hostile village like ours...

01:13:56.070 --> 01:13:58.070
we found a kid who plays Bey?

01:13:58.170 --> 01:14:00.000
I think our only hope is to find out...

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:02.000
We're doing something with the help of our new friend.

01:14:02.000 --> 01:14:05.000
I didn't come with you to play Pay with money!

01:14:05.000 --> 01:14:06.240
Calm down!

01:14:06.240 --> 01:14:08.240
I won't sit and watch you play!

01:14:08.240 --> 01:14:10.240
And I'll do whatever I want!

01:14:10.240 --> 01:14:11.240
What?!

01:14:11.240 --> 01:14:12.070
Let's go, Benky!

01:14:12.070 --> 01:14:13.000
Huh?!

01:14:13.000 --> 01:14:15.190
Kyo-ya, dude!

01:14:15.190 --> 01:14:16.110
Kyo-ya!

01:14:16.110 --> 01:14:17.030
We're back?

01:14:17.030 --> 01:14:22.640
You want some?

01:14:22.640 --> 01:14:25.490
Alright, we'll play together now.

01:14:25.490 --> 01:14:27.490
Hey, Jinga, do you want to play?

01:14:27.490 --> 01:14:28.570
Uh...

01:14:28.570 --> 01:14:29.480
Uh...

01:14:30.030 --> 01:14:36.950
I'm sorry Scylla!

01:14:36.950 --> 01:14:38.050
I don't put it easy at all!

01:14:38.050 --> 01:14:38.920
Oh yeah?

01:14:40.710 --> 01:14:42.150
She was kidding!

01:14:42.150 --> 01:14:44.390
You practiced very well Scylla!

01:14:44.390 --> 01:14:47.710
If you continue to train soon you will become a star!

01:14:47.710 --> 01:14:48.670
Really?

01:14:48.670 --> 01:14:52.830
Yes! But to succeed you have to play with old opponents like us!

01:14:52.830 --> 01:14:55.870
Tell me Scylla, do you always train alone?

01:14:55.870 --> 01:14:57.350
Ah! Aha!

01:14:57.350 --> 01:14:59.510
Our village wasn't like this before!

01:15:00.410 --> 01:15:04.010
One day something bad happened and Bay was kicked out.

01:15:04.010 --> 01:15:04.990
What do you mean?

01:15:04.990 --> 01:15:08.070
What happened, Sheila?

01:15:09.640 --> 01:15:11.180
What's wrong, Madoka?

01:15:13.520 --> 01:15:14.780
I'm sorry.

01:15:14.780 --> 01:15:16.090
What happened?

01:15:16.090 --> 01:15:17.390
Are you hungry, kids?

01:15:18.690 --> 01:15:21.410
Listen, I'll bring you something to eat.

01:15:30.160 --> 01:15:32.310
-Nice table. -Sure.

01:15:32.540 --> 01:15:36.470
Sit here. I'm going to bring food from home.

01:15:36.570 --> 01:15:39.870
Excuse me, but you two, my dad and I will be busy.

01:15:40.190 --> 01:15:42.330
I'll be right back.

01:15:43.020 --> 01:15:46.080
Guys, we are not welcome anywhere.

01:15:46.150 --> 01:15:50.000
Yes, but we are grateful to her for her food.

01:15:50.350 --> 01:15:53.620
Sheila, where have you been all this time?

01:15:53.680 --> 01:16:00.000
-Where did I go? -You dropped Beyblade again, didn't you?

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:01.540
Because I don't want you to play.

01:16:01.620 --> 01:16:03.000
Embros, bring him here.

01:16:03.080 --> 01:16:05.000
No, Dad, he's mine.

01:16:05.080 --> 01:16:06.880
What's going on out there?

01:16:06.960 --> 01:16:09.460
Oh, kids, we have to hide.

01:16:11.330 --> 01:16:14.370
-Sylla! -What's that?

01:16:15.410 --> 01:16:18.680
Sylla? Don't tell me, who gave you the puns?

01:16:18.760 --> 01:16:25.610
-Huh? -What?

01:16:25.690 --> 01:16:27.590
Finally, a gang?

01:16:27.670 --> 01:16:30.000
I didn't say that. You're a slut.

01:16:30.160 --> 01:16:32.360
My mouth doesn't hurt at all!

01:16:32.750 --> 01:16:34.050
Is anyone in here?

01:16:43.500 --> 01:16:47.200
We didn't find any evidence in this crumbling island!

01:16:51.170 --> 01:16:54.870
The island is very small and has a volcano.

01:16:55.700 --> 01:16:57.000
So this is it.

01:16:57.600 --> 01:16:59.700
We only have to look for it there.

01:17:01.790 --> 01:17:17.450
-Are we going to sleep on it? -Stop crying and move on. What's going on?

01:17:33.450 --> 01:17:36.440
- It's great. - Please, start eating, kids.

01:17:36.440 --> 01:17:39.360
- Are you ready? - Thank you, sir.

01:17:39.360 --> 01:17:41.360
- Thank you! - Thank you!

01:17:41.360 --> 01:17:46.470
If I'm not mistaken, you're the Bladers who came to our island today, right?

01:17:46.470 --> 01:17:52.620
It's fine, kids. They transferred to my bay and spent a lot of time with me.

01:17:52.620 --> 01:17:57.130
Yes, indeed. But listen, the village is against you.

01:17:57.130 --> 01:18:00.000
- And for what reason, sir? - Because they're locals.

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:02.530
and they are so much against the Bladers?

01:18:02.530 --> 01:18:04.490
I'll tell you in a nutshell.

01:18:04.490 --> 01:18:08.520
Two weeks ago, a Blader like you came to our island.

01:18:08.520 --> 01:18:12.500
It's a sacred place.

01:18:12.500 --> 01:18:16.280
The god of the dragon is protecting the island from evil.

01:18:16.280 --> 01:18:18.390
We don't want strangers.

01:18:18.390 --> 01:18:20.310
The god of the dragon, huh?

01:18:20.310 --> 01:18:22.310
Interesting.

01:18:22.310 --> 01:18:25.310
I want to see for myself if the dragon really exists.

01:18:25.310 --> 01:18:27.050
But what are you saying?

01:18:27.050 --> 01:18:30.000
I'm going, because...

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:32.000
In front of you, a real dragon!

01:18:38.070 --> 01:18:40.070
He didn't listen to the dancers' warnings.

01:18:41.020 --> 01:18:44.020
He went up to the fireplace alone for training and disappeared.

01:18:46.160 --> 01:18:47.160
For training?

01:18:47.160 --> 01:18:48.160
A real dragon, huh?

01:18:49.180 --> 01:18:50.180
I know who it was!

01:19:01.660 --> 01:19:03.660
Where are we going, Becky?

01:19:05.010 --> 01:19:09.500
Since then, every night, we hear the roaring of a monster from the inferno.

01:19:09.500 --> 01:19:12.500
And the earth is constantly shaking under our feet.

01:19:13.400 --> 01:19:15.900
Everyone says that the dragon god is angry.

01:19:16.420 --> 01:19:17.420
I understand.

01:19:17.420 --> 01:19:20.920
That's why the island's inhabitants are against the strange bladers.

01:19:21.400 --> 01:19:25.640
One night, a strong light fell from the sky to the earth.

01:19:38.960 --> 01:19:42.040
A cauldron! May it be the cauldron of the Dragon God!

01:19:43.460 --> 01:19:45.380
Dragon, please help us!

01:19:46.370 --> 01:19:49.050
A planet that had been silent for so many years has come back to life!

01:19:50.660 --> 01:19:52.340
Light that descends from the sky!

01:19:52.700 --> 01:19:56.380
I knew it! The star's reflection certainly fell on this island!

01:19:56.610 --> 01:19:59.730
So the reflection was coordinated with the power of the Blader!

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:02.520
There's no doubt about it.

01:20:05.090 --> 01:20:07.090
No, no. Do the same thing again.

01:20:07.090 --> 01:20:09.090
That's him! I'm sure of it!

01:20:13.560 --> 01:20:14.560
I got it.

01:20:14.560 --> 01:20:19.870
What is this?

01:20:30.030 --> 01:20:34.550
Exactly! We didn't take into account a very important Blader.

01:20:41.020 --> 01:20:43.000
So you are Rai Oga!

01:20:43.000 --> 01:20:55.130
The Blader who went to the

01:20:55.130 --> 01:20:56.990
Iphestio is Rai Oga! He must have become a magical Blader!

01:20:56.990 --> 01:20:58.230
Shall we go too, guys?

01:20:58.230 --> 01:20:59.230
Yes!

01:20:59.230 --> 01:20:59.960
It's not possible!

01:21:00.090 --> 01:21:04.370
I don't allow any stranger to step on his foot on the holy mountain, it is forbidden!

01:21:04.860 --> 01:21:05.580
But sir...

01:21:06.100 --> 01:21:08.980
I will host you here until your boat arrives.

01:21:09.100 --> 01:21:13.420
But if you make any trouble, unfortunately I will have to kick you out.

01:21:13.580 --> 01:21:18.860
For your own good, I'm telling you, please don't provoke the villagers anymore.

01:21:20.290 --> 01:21:21.170
Dad!

01:21:24.970 --> 01:21:30.000
What are you doing here?

01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:32.110
Kyoya, Kyoya, look!

01:21:32.110 --> 01:21:36.210
It's Rai Oga's Bey!

01:21:36.210 --> 01:21:37.130
I can see it!

01:21:37.130 --> 01:21:39.130
He's holding the new El Drago in his hand.

01:21:39.130 --> 01:21:43.750
So you are the third legendary Blader, Rai Oga!

01:21:43.750 --> 01:21:46.110
Legendary Blader?

01:21:46.110 --> 01:21:49.710
I never imagined that you would be my first opponent.

01:21:49.710 --> 01:21:52.690
But I'm very pleased.

01:21:52.690 --> 01:21:58.360
I will show you how much power I have, me and Leon!

01:21:58.360 --> 01:22:00.000
Hmph! Are you excited?

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:02.000
What's up with your new little game, eh?

01:22:02.000 --> 01:22:07.020
Wrong! Leon Cynodontas has inside him the astral force that El Drago also has.

01:22:07.020 --> 01:22:09.020
Now you will see!

01:22:09.020 --> 01:22:10.950
Astral force?

01:22:10.950 --> 01:22:12.850
The conditions of battle are the same.

01:22:12.850 --> 01:22:15.750
It's time to learn that you will not be the best forever.

01:22:15.750 --> 01:22:17.740
So they are the same then?

01:22:17.740 --> 01:22:21.570
Strange! You intend to defeat the dragon emperor?

01:22:21.570 --> 01:22:24.570
And the destroyer El Drago?

01:22:24.570 --> 01:22:27.650
Destroyer El Drago!

01:22:28.540 --> 01:22:30.000
Embrace me, my friend!

01:22:30.220 --> 01:22:32.140
Open the doors!

01:22:41.450 --> 01:22:43.170
There's an explosion again!

01:22:43.170 --> 01:22:44.220
We made it!

01:22:44.220 --> 01:22:47.340
We're moving! Please, help us!

01:22:49.670 --> 01:22:51.350
What are we going to do, Jinga?

01:22:53.120 --> 01:22:55.600
Well, we've never been to this house.

01:22:55.600 --> 01:22:56.440
What?

01:22:56.440 --> 01:22:58.440
We don't know Scylla and her father.

01:22:59.120 --> 01:23:00.000
We don't know them.

01:23:00.190 --> 01:23:02.190
Otherwise they will mess you up, okay?

01:23:02.830 --> 01:23:04.830
Okay, I got it, Jinga.

01:23:05.100 --> 01:23:07.100
Great, it's time to leave.

01:23:09.980 --> 01:23:10.680
Quickly!

01:23:18.270 --> 01:23:20.310
You're not leaving, are you?

01:23:20.540 --> 01:23:22.310
I'll tell you in the light.

01:23:30.640 --> 01:23:33.970
-You're incompetent. -But we haven't started yet.

01:23:34.140 --> 01:23:36.340
Resistance, Leon!

01:23:38.840 --> 01:23:42.390
Strong! Forward!

01:23:43.980 --> 01:23:48.640
Yes! On him, Gioia!

01:23:48.690 --> 01:23:52.600
Throw him into the fire!

01:24:03.710 --> 01:24:08.070
Do you think that a defensive Bey can fight with my El Drago?

01:24:08.070 --> 01:24:09.840
I'm sorry, my friend.

01:24:09.840 --> 01:24:12.930
Leon Kynodontas is not just a defensive Bey.

01:24:12.930 --> 01:24:18.790
Take this!

01:24:18.790 --> 01:24:21.330
Give me the base!

01:24:21.330 --> 01:24:27.070
Leon Kynodontas!

01:24:27.070 --> 01:24:30.000
This is the power of my new Leon!

01:24:36.080 --> 01:24:37.910
It was the opposite!

01:24:37.910 --> 01:24:42.910
Let's see.

01:24:42.910 --> 01:24:44.880
The conditions are the same, right?

01:24:44.880 --> 01:24:54.090
So, in the next battle, the difference in the power of the Bladers will be hidden, right?

01:24:57.980 --> 01:25:00.000
That's bad, man!

01:25:00.250 --> 01:25:03.610
Of course, you still don't have your Bey with you!

01:25:03.610 --> 01:25:07.680
Oh, really?

01:25:07.680 --> 01:25:10.830
Look! It's Rai Oga!

01:25:10.830 --> 01:25:13.950
No, no, it's Bengi!

01:25:13.950 --> 01:25:18.970
Come on! I'll show you the difference between us!

01:25:18.970 --> 01:25:23.400
Huh! You're kidding! Get ready, Rai Oga!
